Third-party components

index.html embeds the open-source map library MapLibre GL JS and the libraries
it includes. They are not covered by the license above: each stays under its
own license (BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, MIT or ISC).
Their copyright notices and full license texts are in the About tab of
index.html and are listed in README.md. indexRFD.html contains no third-party
code.

Map content

The map in index.html loads basemap tiles from Esri (World Imagery, World Street
Map, World Topographic Map). That content is not part of this repository, is not
covered by the license above and is subject to Esri's terms of use, which do not
permit commercial use without an Esri license. The map feature of index.html is
therefore intended for personal / non-commercial use. indexRFD.html contains no
map content.
